OL,3,GNEWSATwo men jailed after drugs found
OL,4,Astashed in vinery
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men involved in the supply of class
OL,7,FA and class B drugs found stashed in a
OL,8,Fvinery have been jailed.
OL,10,FRichard Le Cras, 47, and Matthew
OL,11,FLovell, 49, pleaded guilty at
OL,12,FGuernsey's Royal Court to the supply of
OL,13,FMDMA, ketamine, cannabis and cannabis
OL,14,Fresin.
OL,16,FLovell also admitted to two counts of
OL,17,Fconverting or transferring proceeds of
OL,18,Fcriminal conduct, after officers
OL,19,Funcovered about #460,000 in criminal
OL,20,Ffunds.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
